# Environment Variables
# ------------------------
.env
backend/.envsuggestion/providers.py — Provider message text completely rewritten using SuggestionMessenger
suggestion/engine.py — Full Sprint 2 integration (cooldown gating, duplicate suppression, activity-aware delivery delays, metrics instrumentation, lifecycle events)
observability/cognitive_logger.py — Extended with suggestion lifecycle, cooldown, and activity events
test_sprint2.py — 35 comprehensive tests covering all Sprint 2 features
config.py — Suggestion cooldown configuration values
Architecture

CooldownManager    ActivityMonitor    SuggestionMetrics
        \               |                  /
         \              |                 /
          → SuggestionEngine (orchestrator) ←
                     |
              Providers (GeneralDevelopmentProvider)
                     |
              SuggestionMessenger (context-aware text)
JARVIS 3.0's Operating Intelligence layer now has a fully operational, test-validated suggestion engine that builds on the stable Reactive Engine without touching any existing voice/command infrastructure.

